{
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_angrytunes_Draw_73_41": "* 呃啊... 他们居然不让我\n  上飞机... 你问为啥？",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_angrytunes_Draw_73_46": "* 因为我的胳膊“太大了！”，\n  他们不让我同时占多个\n  座位！",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_angrytunes_Draw_73_52": "* 呃啊啊啊... 这简直让我太...\n  太...！生气了！！！我真想\n  去揍什么东西泄泄愤！",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_angrytunes_Draw_73_58": "* ...别担心，我不会揍你的。\n  你超酷的。",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_primflower_Draw_73_42": "* 嗨，你好啊~          \n* 我们之前好像\n  没见过呢。",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_primflower_Draw_73_82": "* 我叫Primflower，\n  但我的朋友都叫我Prim。\n* 很荣幸认识您～",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_primflower_Draw_73_94": "* 不久前，我决定踏上一段\n  自我探索的旅程。",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_primflower_Draw_73_463": "* （你获得了暗影斗篷。）",
    "losts_gml_Object_oTextC3_outskirts_interact3_Step_0_14": "* 咋地了，Kris？",
    "losts_gml_Object_oTextC3_outskirts_interact3_Step_0_16": "* 我越来越饿了！！",
    "losts_gml_Object_oTextC3_outskirts_interact3_Step_0_38": "* 你越是让我们长时间\n  留在这里...",
    "losts_gml_Object_oTextC3_outskirts_interact3_Step_0_45": "* 我盯着那边笼子里的\n  鸡的时间就越久。",
    "losts_gml_Object_oTextC3_outskirts_interact3_Step_0_53": "* 然后我就会越饿！！",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_angrytunes_Draw_73_64": "* 我该把怒火发泄到谁身上呢...？\n  要不就站在我身边的那个人？",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_angrytunes_Draw_73_70": "* 嗯，他太聒噪了。\n  我敢说没人会介意我揍他的！",
    "losts_gml_Object_oTextC3_kreid_interact1_Step_0_25": "* 处境不利！",
    "losts_gml_Object_oTextC3_kreid_interact1_Step_0_29": "* 你仿佛正被准星\n  牢牢锁定...",
    "losts_gml_Object_oTextC3_kreid_interact1_Step_0_33": "* 在这种时候读这条文本\n  似乎并不是明智之举。",
    "losts_gml_Object_oTextC3_outskirts_interact2_Step_0_12": "* 好多钱...",
    "losts_gml_Object_oTextC3_outskirts_interact2_Step_0_19": "* 没想到你这么有钱，\n  Kris。",
    "losts_gml_Object_oTextC3_outskirts_interact2_Step_0_26": "* 看来我知道下次\n  该由谁请客了，嘿嘿。",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_battle_sio_Draw_73_1386": "* Ralsei释放了安抚！\n* 但是敌人还未陷入{ODivinePotatoDeityHearMyPleaAndGrantThyPowerToAlterTheColorOfThisSacredTextIntoBlue}疲惫{ODivinePotatoDeityIEntreatTheeRestoreTheHueOfThisConsecratedScript}...",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_battle_sof_Draw_73_4279": "* Ralsei释放了安抚！\n* 但是敌人还未陷入{ODivinePotatoDeityHearMyPleaAndGrantThyPowerToAlterTheColorOfThisSacredTextIntoBlue}疲惫{ODivinePotatoDeityIEntreatTheeRestoreTheHueOfThisConsecratedScript}...",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_foane_pretalk_1_Draw_73_134": "（突然...！）",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_foane_ex_Draw_73_188": "* 再次展露{ODivinePotatoDeityHearMyPleaAndGrantThyPowerToAlterTheColorOfThisSacredTextIntoRed}笑容{ODivinePotatoDeityIEntreatTheeRestoreTheHueOfThisConsecratedScript}的感觉\n  真是太美妙了！",
    "losts_gml_Object_obj_foane_pretalk_1_Draw_73_125": "（{c:purple}暗影斗篷{/c}正在共鸣...）",
